flowchart LR
    U[Users / Reviewers] --> W[Web Portal<br/>Three-column evidence workspace]
    W --> G[API Gateway<br/>FastAPI /api/v1]
    G --> I[Identity / RBAC]
    G --> ING[Ingestion Service]
    G --> AW[Alert / Action Workflow]
    G --> RAG[RAG Retrieval]

    ING --> OS[(Object Storage<br/>S3-compatible / local demo)]
    ING --> OCR[OCR / Text Extraction]
    OCR --> IP[Intelligence Pipeline<br/>classification · entities · actions · deadlines · summary · priority]
    IP --> VI[(Vector Index)]
    IP --> MDB[(Metadata / Actions DB<br/>PostgreSQL)]
    RAG --> VI
    RAG --> MDB
    AW --> MDB
    AW --> N[Notifications]
    MDB --> AN[Analytics]
    MDB --> AL[(Append-only Audit Log)]
    I --> AL
    IP --> AL
    AW --> AL

